					Mil. 4, 8, 49</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strătĭōtĭcum</span></b> ,
				i, n., <i>a kind of
				eye-salve</i>, <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 33</span></i>; Inscr. Spon. Misc.
			Ant. p. 237.</div>
